  "comment": "The assets the PS5 title ships, each with its origin and licence (ps5/tools/build-assets.py; the notices in ps5/ASSETS.md are written from this file). Only assets with a clear licence are listed: the rest of the asset pack is not shipped, and samples that use such assets get replacements made or fetched here.",
