    "download": "files fetched at pinned SHA-256 hashes into build/ps5/downloads/: the asset pack's (SaschaWillems/Vulkan-Assets at a27c0e584434) whose licences are clear",
    "generated": "ps5/tools/generate_assets.py: geometry and noise written there, or CC0 files it downloads (Poly Haven; Khronos's glTF-Sample-Assets at f36bfdabd1031c3cf6689a50570b8cdf3678b49c) at pinned SHA-256 hashes",
    "kit": "the UI module's fonts and sounds, from PS5_VKHomebrewUI at the revision ps5/ui/setup-kit.sh pins (BlackBearReloaded's ps5-homebrew-ui with a Vulkan backend), exported into .deps/hui; installed under hui/ when the title links the UI module"
  },
